{# Charmed Apache Kafka release notes template.

   Reproduces the structure of the product's published release notes, most
   recently revision 248:
   https://canonical.com/data/kafka/docs/4/reference/release-notes/revision-248/
   source: canonical/kafka-operator, docs/reference/release-notes/revision-248.md

   Differences from base.md.j2, and why:
   - MyST frontmatter with `html_meta.description` and a
     `(reference-release-notes-revision-N)=` anchor, as the docs build requires.
   - Title is `# Revision N` (the docs site supplies the product name); the
     base template's `**date**` line is dropped because the published notes
     carry no date line.
   - Intro links use Diataxis cross-references (`how-to-deploy-index`,
     `how-to-upgrade`, `reference-requirements`) resolved by the docs build,
     not absolute URLs.
   - The builder's "Other improvements" category renders as **Improvements**,
     which is the section name this product uses (see CATEGORY_LABELS below).
   - Entries use `- ` bullets and link the PR only (no commit link), matching
     the published format: `- [JIRA](url) - message [#NNN](pr url)`.
   - Compatibility is a per-charm table with a Juju version column and an
     Artefacts column (distribution/snap), followed by the upstream Apache
     Kafka release-notes links.
#}
{% extends "base.md.j2" %}

{# Map the builder's fixed DA186 categories onto this product's section names. #}
{% set CATEGORY_LABELS = {
     "Features": "Features",
     "Breaking changes": "Breaking changes",
     "Security": "Security",
     "Bug fixes": "Bug fixes",
     "Other improvements": "Improvements",
   } %}

{% block frontmatter %}
---
myst:
  html_meta:
    description: "Charmed Apache Kafka {{ title | lower }} release notes - TODO: one-sentence summary of the headline changes."
---

(reference-release-notes-{{ title | lower | replace(" ", "-") }})=
{% endblock %}

{% block date_line %}{% endblock %}

{% block introduction %}

<!-- TODO: Write a brief summary of the most important changes in this release. -->

{% block intro_links %}
[Charmhub](https://charmhub.io/kafka) | [Deploy guide](how-to-deploy-index) | [Upgrade instructions](how-to-upgrade) | [System requirements](reference-requirements)
{% endblock %}
{% endblock %}

{% block changelog %}
{% for category in category_order %}
{% if categories.get(category) %}

## {{ CATEGORY_LABELS.get(category, category) }}

{% for entry in categories[category] %}
- {% if entry.jira_ids %}{% for jira in entry.jira_ids %}[{{ jira }}](https://warthogs.atlassian.net/browse/{{ jira }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} - {% endif %}{{ entry.message }}{% if entry.pr_number %} [#{{ entry.pr_number }}]({{ entry.pr_url }}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endblock %}

